# Backups never go into Git (audit F21, docs/ops/BACKUP_CLASSIFICATION.md): write them to BACKUP_DIR outside the
# repository. The 2026-09-26 snapshot already tracked under backups/ stays until the owner decides
# (docs/ops/GIT_HISTORY_REMEDIATION_PLAN.md); ignoring a path does not untrack existing files.
backups/
*.dump.age
